{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"馬太福音","commonName":"馬太福音","title":"馬太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"91a01a9d2852a1096cdedbf305ffd3780f39083c509861f515306fc3cd56733a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌受試探"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["當時，耶穌被聖靈引到曠野，受魔鬼的試探。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他禁食四十晝夜，後來就餓了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那試探人的進前來，對他說：「你若是上帝的兒子，可以吩咐這些石頭變成食物。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶穌卻回答說：「經上記着說：",{"text":"人活着，不是單靠食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是靠上帝口裏所出的一切話。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["魔鬼就帶他進了聖城，叫他站在殿頂",{"noteId":3},"上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["對他說：「你若是上帝的兒子，可以跳下去，因為經上記着說：",{"text":"主要為你吩咐他的使者","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用手托着你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你的腳碰在石頭上。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶穌對他說：「經上又記着說：『不可試探主－你的上帝。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["魔鬼又帶他上了一座最高的山，將世上的萬國與萬國的榮華都指給他看，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["對他說：「你若俯伏拜我，我就把這一切都賜給你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶穌說：「撒但",{"noteId":4},"，退去吧！因為經上記着說：",{"text":"當拜主－你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"單要事奉他。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["於是，魔鬼離了耶穌，有天使來伺候他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["開始在加利利傳道"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶穌聽見約翰下了監，就退到加利利去；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["後又離開拿撒勒，往迦百農去，就住在那裏。那地方靠海，在西布倫和拿弗他利的邊界上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["這是要應驗先知以賽亞的話，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["說：",{"text":"西布倫地，拿弗他利地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是沿海的路，約旦河外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人的加利利地－","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那坐在黑暗裏的百姓看見了大光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在死蔭之地的人有光發現照着他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["從那時候，耶穌就傳起道來，說：「天國近了，你們應當悔改！」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼召四個漁夫"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶穌在加利利海邊行走，看見弟兄二人，就是那稱呼彼得的西門和他兄弟安得烈，在海裏撒網；他們本是打魚的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶穌對他們說：「來跟從我，我要叫你們得人如得魚一樣。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他們就立刻捨了網，跟從了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["從那裏往前走，又看見弟兄二人，就是西庇太的兒子雅各和他兄弟約翰，同他們的父親西庇太在船上補網，耶穌就招呼他們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["他們立刻捨了船，別了父親，跟從了耶穌。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌向廣大的群眾傳道"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶穌走遍加利利，在各會堂裏教訓人，傳天國的福音，醫治百姓各樣的病症。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他的名聲就傳遍了敘利亞。那裏的人把一切害病的，就是害各樣疾病、各樣疼痛的和被鬼附的、癲癇的、癱瘓的，都帶了來，耶穌就治好了他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["當下，有許多人從加利利、低加坡里、耶路撒冷、猶太、約旦河外來跟着他。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"頂：原文是翅","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":5}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"就是抵擋的意思，乃魔鬼的別名","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}